      "content": "okay got it. so i'd be the one filing the claim since the risk passed to me at the loading port. one more thing—under CIF 2020, is there a minimum amount of insurance coverage the seller is legally required to provide, or can they just buy the absolute cheapest policy possible to satisfy the term?",
